.env
device_credentials.json
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# Detection exports and the like — but NOT the firmware's partition table, which is
# hand-authored source the build reads by name (sdkconfig CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_
# FILENAME). Without the negation the broad rule below swallowed it, so a fresh clone
# could not build until the file was copied in by hand.
*.csv
!firmware/esp32/partitions.csv
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
status.json
